# Regenerate with: vhs demo/demo.tape
Output demo/demo.gif

Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1000
Set Height 650
Set Padding 16
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 35ms

Type "cat demo/app.py"
Enter
Sleep 2.5s

Type "python3 skills/complexity-optimizer/scripts/analyze_complexity.py demo --format markdown"
Enter
Sleep 6s
